SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Page updated: Maine Judicial Branch Jury Stat
 us Notices
DESCRIPTION:This page's content changed since the last check. Visit the pa
 ge directly to review the update.\n\nWhat changed (text excerpt):\nAdded:\
 n  + All Jurors selected in the matter of State of Maine vs Daniel Markey\
 , please report on Tuesday\, August 25th\, 2026\, at 8:30 am: 6\, 11\, 17\
 , 19\, 29\, 34\, 106\, 108\, 114\, 122\, 131\, 138\, 172\, 264\, 294.\n  +
  August 24\, 2026\n  + Waldo County Superior Court - Belfast\n  + All Juro
 rs selected for State vs Joshua Grant please report to the Waldo County Co
 urt on Wednesday August 26th at 9:00 am. Upon arrival please report to Cou
 rtroom #2 upstairs and check in with the Jury Clerk.\n  + If you have any 
 questions\, please call 338-3107 Monday through Friday between 8 am and 4 
 pm.\n  + PROHIBITION OF ELECTRONIC DEVICES:\n  + Please be advised that pu
 rsuant to Administrative Order JB-20-01\, use of electronic devices during
  trial or while in deliberations are prohibited and all devices will need 
 to be temporarily surrendered. During jury selection\, all devices must be
  turned off.\n  + August 24\, 2026\n  + All July/August Traverse Jurors pl
 ease check the website or phone line on Friday\, August 28th after 5pm for
  further information and reporting instructions.\n  + August 24\, 2026\nRe
 moved:\n  - All Jurors selected in the matter of State of Maine vs Daniel 
 Markey\, please report on Monday\, August 24th\, 2026\, at 9am: 6\, 11\, 1
 7\, 19\, 29\, 34\, 106\, 108\, 114\, 122\, 131\, 138\, 172\, 264\, 294.\n 
  - August 21\, 2026\n  - The following July/August Traverse Jurors are to 
 report to the York Judicial Center in Biddeford on Monday\, August 24th at
  9am\n  - 3\, 7\, 8\, 11\, 12\, 14\, 16\, 17\, 18\, 21\, 26\, 27\, 32\, 46
 \, 49\, 56\, 57\n[diff truncated]\nhttps://www.courts.maine.gov/juror/noti
 ce.shtml
URL:https://www.courts.maine.gov/juror/notice.shtml
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
